From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "D.R.racer" <drracer@seznam.cz>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:19:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] media: cedrus: print the VE version once at first
 power-up

The version register is only readable while the VE is powered, so log
it the first time the VE is resumed.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
index 57a8826d8..c9944634a 100644
--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@
 #include "cedrus_enc.h"
 #include "cedrus_engine.h"
 #include "cedrus_proc.h"
+#include "cedrus_regs.h"
 
 /* Media */
 
@@ -293,6 +294,9 @@ static int cedrus_resume(struct device *dev)
 		goto error_clock_mod;
 	}
 
+	dev_info_once(dev, "VE version %#06lx\n",
+		      VE_VERSION_VALUE(readl(cedrus_dev->io_base + VE_VERSION)));
+
 	return 0;
 
 error_clock_mod:
-- 
2.55.0

